From 527d1a26a20aa85361b07b58695a1f0ff6d881cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yashgix <125082291+yashgix@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:25:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(remote): keep typing responsive under bulk terminal
 output on SSH hosts

Adds an interactive lane, an adaptive bulk window, per-viewer credit accounting, backpressure to the PTY, a bounded outbound queue and attachment identity for reconnects.
